  <jpcrp030000-asr_E01130-000:NotesRegardingLossOnBusinessWithdrawalTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;注８. 事業撤退損失&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;一部の中国連結子会社の事業撤退に伴う損失見込額を計上しております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp030000-asr_E01130-000:NotesRegardingLossOnBusinessWithdrawalTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingReclassificationAdjustmentsAndTaxEffectsRelatingToOtherComprehensiveIncomeTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;注１．その他の包括利益に係る組替調整額及び税効果額&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:right;padding-right:9pt;"&gt;（単位：百万円）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:30.1pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:428.3pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
